# The build context is the repository root, because the image copies one file
# from scripts/. Everything else in the repository is dead weight on the
# builder upload -- rustd/target alone is 12GB on a developer machine, and the
# root .dockerignore does not exclude it because the daemon image is built in
# CI, where no target directory exists.
#
# Deny-all then allow the one file, so a new directory added to the repository
# never silently joins this upload.
*
!scripts/dragonfly-cluster.sh
